Coffee_Delivery

agents:
	humans: Employee
	robots: Robot1

locations: kitchen, bedroom
resources: coffee

Robot1:
	1: moveTo kitchen
	2: pick coffee
	3: moveTo bedroom until position(Employee, kitchen)
Employee:
	1: moveTo kitchen else stop
	2: follow Robot1

Conclusion:
<div>(position(Employee, kitchen) && position(Robot1, bedroom) && soc(Robot1) > 0)</div>
